<title>Ethiopia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ethiopia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ethiopia-2026-11-01T21:18:42.489Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 21:18:42 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Prime Minister Abiy Ahmed is sending senior ministers to military training in Hurso while Ethiopian drones are striking targets in Sudan and within Ethiopia, including a displacement camp in Amhara and civilians gathering grain in Tigray. Sudan accuses Ethiopia of using Assosa Airport as a launch base for RSF drones and of supplying arms to the RSF, linking the attacks to cross-border operations. Two attacks in Oromia killed 60 Orthodox Christians, heightening sectarian tension, and thousands of refugees are fleeing into Kenya via Moyale. The conflict coexists with the Fano insurgency in Amhara that began in 2023. 2,824 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFA1LVJRU1FVNjJwb1g1TFM3bzYwOFlEVkYyWFF5UGx4aDlXQ1pZSHI2VWpucmFuT2tTeWg3MUdvajR1aGxUN1FrSUlJMC1sUlVUR1RoUXFFdGdEaWNDX1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxPTXJuUFVpQk5NTVJaRUlhU2lJWFp5ZXBrZHllczJ1N29DTzBza2UyTVd6Z1U3d3dRTFRnUjdZeTc3ZTd1WFFELWI5TWNXODNMMlBsOTdaSXl4UWpHQ29kNk4wYTRMeUtqNlczSlZzTGJ4QU1TLU9sNjU3QmtsOTRCY1lUa0ZyQlVORjRXeFZUYWdyRnFDanBpYmxOcU5hSW9zS1p0SmR5dWx6ZlU?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxPMzRpYW0xVmxsU05raFJ1UWdpd0J6WHBVdlJ3V3FPTnVJMERvLWhlc2xEVHhaMktHeEctTC1YMmVVRGt3V1lnY0hMd1FxQWtMNjFBVHQ3cEVPZmk4TlAtbVZPZGxKLXhweXpfQ1VFOEdQZXgwWG9RV0FaOXlDVVlrdThfc1VOVTdqdW1NR3FsQjFDLXBXcjlTSHByWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;People Daily&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUkFVX3lxTE1rSkl5UGw0Nl9hMzVUNnhwVFVQaWV1NVNzS3BVWDE3eWVjX19ySXhFLXgzZ3cxbWhOcFljMVBkWjhoYUlSTDFaenJycFBtb1laZEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Addis Standard&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quo